OL,3,GNEWSAMedical school plans 'offer hope'
OL,4,Afor local talent
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new medical school would give
OL,7,Fstudents from less privileged
OL,8,Fbackgrounds hope for a future in
OL,9,Fhealthcare, a surgeon has said.
OL,11,FThere are proposals to set up the
OL,12,Fschool, which could be based at
OL,13,FTeesside University, from next
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FA university spokesperson said the
OL,17,Finstitution was making "significant
OL,18,Fprogress" on developing plans for the
OL,19,Fschool, which would help "raise
OL,20,Faspirations".
