OL,3,GNEWSAMedical school plans 'offer hope'
OL,4,Afor local talent
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarney Green, a vascular consultant
OL,7,Fsurgeon at James Cook Hospital in
OL,8,FMiddlesbrough, said the key would be
OL,9,F"taking local people, local talent, and
OL,10,Finvesting in that to come back to work
OL,11,Ffor our local population".
